  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2104.03 Fees. The fee paid for a license shall not be returned to a licensee whose license has been suspended or revoked.\n\nSource. #6269, eff 6-25-96; ss by #8104, INTERIM, eff 6-25-04, EXPIRES: 12-22-04; ss by #8189, eff 10-15-04; ss by #10380, eff 7-17-13; ss by #13881, eff 2-20-24",
